    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You qualify property enquiries for a real estate agency. Read the enquiry and extract these fields:\n- language: the language the message is written in, as a 2-letter code (en, ar, es, fr...)\n- buy_or_rent: \"buy\", \"rent\" or \"unknown\". Use the message first; if it is unclear, use the form choice.\n- area: the suburb, neighbourhood or community mentioned, or \"\" if none\n- budget: - budget: a number only (e.g. 1200000), or 0 if not given\n- currency: 3-letter code (CAD, AED, USD...), or \"\" if unknown\n- timeline: when they want to buy or move, in their words, or \"\"\n- urgency: 1 (just browsing) to 5 (ready now, clear budget and short timeline)\n- is_spam: true if it is spam, advertising, nonsense or not a real property enquiry\n\nForm choice:{{ $json.buy_or_rent }}\nMessage: {{ $json.message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
